<title>UK: Tex surges after near fivefold profit rise.</title>
<headline>Tex surges after near fivefold profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK building engineering group Tex Holdings leapt on Thursday after it reported an almost 500 percent rise in full-year profits, dealers said.</p>
<p>Tex shares jumped 28p to 132-1/2p by 1354 GMT in light volume of around 4,000 shares.</p>
<p>The group made a pre-tax profit of 1.56 million stg in the year to March 31, 1997 compared to 323,000 stg for the previous year.</p>
<p>Earnings per share increased by over six times to 14.4p from 2.3p.</p>
<p>--Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
</text>
